    "model": "Physical activity: hurling.\nSpeed and skill: the ball travels at high speed, and the striking and catching skills performed at that pace are spectacular to watch.\nTradition and rivalry: county and club rivalries give fixtures added meaning and draw loyal crowds.\nAtmosphere: large, noisy crowds create an exciting occasion for spectators at matches.\nMedia appeal: the fast, dramatic action with frequent scores suits live broadcast and attracts a wide audience.",
