    "model": "Activity: soccer, with video assistant referee technology.\nAdvantage: officials can review decisions on goals, penalties and red cards, so incorrect calls on key moments can be corrected.\nThis improves fairness and accuracy, which increases trust in the result.\nDisadvantage: reviews stop play for a long time, which breaks the flow of the game and can reduce excitement for players and spectators.",
