    "marks": 4,
    "model": "Named physical activity: soccer.\nWhen an opponent is lying injured, the team in possession kicks the ball out of play so the player can get treatment.\nWhen play restarts, the team awarded the throw-in gives the ball back to the opposition instead of keeping the advantage.\nThe rules do not require this, but it is expected as good sportsmanship because the player's welfare comes before winning possession.",
