    "marks": 6,
    "model": "Physical activity: soccer.\nSporting movement: instep kick.\nPlane: sagittal.\nAxis: frontal.\nThe leg swings forwards and backwards through the sagittal plane, which divides the body into left and right halves.\nFlexion and extension of the hip and knee happen around the frontal axis, which runs horizontally from side to side across the body.",
