    "model": "Technology 1 (swimming): Full-body polyurethane swimsuits compress the body, trap air and reduce drag in the water, which helped swimmers set a large number of world records in 2008 and 2009.\nTechnology 2 (athletics): Carbon-plated running shoes return energy with each stride and reduce fatigue, which improves running economy and times.",
