    "model": "Physical benefit: It raises heart rate, body temperature and blood flow to the working muscles, which increases the speed of muscle contraction and the range of movement at the joints.\nInjury prevention: Warm muscles and mobile joints are far less likely to be strained by a sudden maximal effort.",
