    "marks": 10,
    "model": "PED 1: Anabolic steroids. How it affects performance: It copies testosterone and builds muscle mass, giving greater strength and power and faster recovery between training sessions.\nPED 2: Erythropoietin (EPO). How it affects performance: It increases red blood cell production, so the blood carries more oxygen to the muscles and endurance improves.",
