    "label": "(a)(i)",
    "marks": 12,
    "model": "Mass participation sports: Matches the large number of people taking part in an event at the same time. Example: the Dublin City Marathon.\nPlay: Matches activities that focus on fun and enjoyment. Example: children playing tag in a park.\nOutdoor and adventure: Matches activities with an element of risk taking place outdoors. Example: rock climbing.",
